  "Changes": "Direct-part-mark preprocessing stores clipped-window means as bytes and advances bounded column/window sums once per row. Dark and light retries share those means instead of retaining an image-sized Int64 summed-area table. Retry pixels, order, profiles, attempt limits and recognition allowances are unchanged; partial means are discarded on cancellation or deadline expiry.",
